=== CLARIFICATION of the three non-zero greps above ===
Every one is a COMMENT DISCLAIMING the thing, not code implementing it. Verified by inspection:

  SpeciesTransport.hpp:49  "No reaction rate, no stoichiometry, no Arrhenius -- those are P18.4-P18.6"
  SpeciesTransport.hpp:20  "There is no SpeciesConvectionAssembler and no"
  SpeciesTransport.hpp:21  "SpeciesDiffusionAssembler here, deliberately."
  SpeciesTransport.hpp:15  "... = -div(J_i) + omega_i        omega_i = 0 in P18.2"
  SpeciesTransport.hpp:72  "omega_i = 0 is this type default-constructed for N species over N cells."
  SpeciesTransport.cpp:97  "Explicitly zero, not default-constructed-and-hoped: omega_i = 0 is"

So: NO chemistry, NO stoichiometry, NO Arrhenius, and NO duplicate assembler exists. The greps are
recorded as-run rather than tightened to exclude comments, because a grep that skips comments could
also skip a real occurrence -- reporting the raw count and resolving it by inspection is the safer
direction.
